      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FIOPROSPERO (1) is the class runner and has been perfectly placed here. Scored over today's trip in a BM72 at Canterbury three back. Has subsequently been competitive including a decent run in the Port Macquarie Cup three weeks ago. Has plenty of weight but should be too good for this field. DANCE DANCE DANCE (7) impressed two back in a BM82 at Port Macquarie then was outclassed in the Cup at the same track most recently. Can sneak into the money without surprising. ANGEL FEET (3) came from last in a small field to finish fifth last start over the mile at this track. Has been to this trip once and filled a placing. Ready to do something at the third run back. LENSMAN (2) hasn't won since June last year but is rarely far away.",
